// RuneSquares uses the original revision-377 interface and its four transmitted edge varps.
// VERIFIED interface layout: 8x8 boxes; 56 vertical and 56 horizontal interior edges.
// CANDIDATE: Burthorpe Games Room dots-and-boxes gives another move for a completed box,
// and the final score is decided when all boxes are complete.

